      </div>
      <p class="hint">This SVG has two layers: a cut line and an engrave layer, built from your exact name/number/font/position. It's the same file we cut from, so what you download is what you get.</p>

      <div class="proof-note">
        <span class="en-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
        <div><p><strong>Double-check the spelling and number.</strong> We cut straight from the file above, so nothing gets manually redrawn. We'll still confirm your order by email or text within one business day before it goes into production.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="upload-progress" id="uploadProgress">
        <div class="up-bar"><div class="up-fill" id="upFill"></div></div>
        <div class="up-label" id="upLabel">Working...</div>
      </div>
      <div class="cart-err" id="cartErr">Something went wrong adding this to your cart. Please try again, or email help@threadbreak.com and we'll sort it out.</div>

      <div class="btn-row"><button type="button" class="back" data-back="3">Back</button><button type="button" class="next" id="checkout">Add to Cart</button></div>
      <p class="hint">Production typically takes 2-3 weeks after order confirmation. Shipping transit time is additional.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
